{"message": "I definitely lean toward deep, focused conversations. 

When you stick with a single subject, you actually get the chance to move past surface-level opinions and uncover nuances you wouldn't notice otherwise. There’s something really satisfying about pulling at a thread, examining the contradictions, and building a shared, complex understanding together. 

